# ░░▀░▀░▀▀▀░░▀░░▀░▀░░░▀░▀░▀▀▀░▀░░░▀▀▀░░░░░░░░░░  
# ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
# ░░ sample env variables ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
# ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
#
# abcnorio-meta compose environment
# Copy to .env and fill in all values before running `docker compose up`.
# See services description doc for full variable reference.
# Only vars that compose.yml interpolates with ${VAR} belong here.
# ASTRO_BUILD_TRIGGER_SECRET is owned here and injected into orchestrator + WP containers.
# WP runtime vars (salts, DB_HOST, TTL, WP_SAVE_TRIGGER_QUEUE_ENABLED etc.) go in wp/runtime.env, wp/dev.env, wp/staging.env.
# Astro has no env files: compose.yml builds its env from the vars here (x-frontend-urls, x-astro-env anchors).

# Shared secret for orchestrator auth; injected into the orchestrator and WP containers
ASTRO_BUILD_TRIGGER_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string

# Optional overrides (compose has defaults)
# DEV_MODE=development
# STAGING_MODE=staging
# FORMS_MIN_SUBMIT_MS=2500
# WP_SQL_INIT_SCRIPT=./wp/sql/001-dev-staging-dbs.sh

# Caddyfile paths (relative to compose.yml or absolute host paths)
PROXY_CADDYFILE=./proxy/Caddyfile
STATIC_SERVER_CADDYFILE=./web/Caddyfile

# Repo-local directory for proxy access logs (bind-mounted into proxy container).
# fail2ban reads these host-side files directly — must match logpath in f2b/fail2ban/jail.local.
PROXY_LOG_DIR=./proxy/logs

# Space-separated public IPs/CIDRs fail2ban never bans (e.g. your office or home IP). Loopback is always ignored.
# Rerun `just setup-fail2ban` after changing.
F2B_IGNORE_IPS=

# Static site serving
STATIC_SERVER_SITE_DIR=/host/path/to/web/static

# MariaDB local port (exposed on host for tooling/debugging)
LOCAL_DB_PORT=3306

# Shared UID/GID for cross-container file ownership
# GID must exist on host; containers are added to this group at build time
PROJECT_UID=1000
PROJECT_GID=2000
PROJECT_GROUP=abcnorio

# --- Dev WP (abcwpdev) ---
# DEV_USER and DEV_HOST_ROOT are used by compose.yml for image build args and bind mounts
DEV_USER=root
DEV_HOST_ROOT=/host/path/to/wp/dev/
DEV_DB_USER=your-dev-db-user
DEV_DB_PASSWORD=your-dev-db-password
DEV_DB_NAME=your-dev-db-name
# Table prefix shared by dev and staging WP and the orchestrator
DB_PREFIX=abcwp_
# Salts, WP_HOME, WP_ENV, DEBUG, TTL etc. go in wp/dev.env and wp/runtime.env (not here)

# --- Staging WP (abcwpstaging) ---
# STAGING_USER and STAGING_HOST_ROOT are used by compose.yml for image build args and bind mounts
STAGING_USER=root
STAGING_HOST_ROOT=/host/path/to/wp/staging/
STAGING_DB_USER=your-staging-db-user
STAGING_DB_PASSWORD=your-staging-db-password
STAGING_DB_NAME=your-staging-db-name
# MariaDB root password (one server shared by dev and staging)
DB_ROOT_PASSWORD=your-mariadb-root-password
# Salts, WP_HOME, WP_ENV, DEBUG etc. go in wp/staging.env (not here)

# --- Astro frontend ---
ASTRO_HOST_ROOT=/host/path/to/abcnorio-astro
ASTRO_SITE_DIR=/host/path/to/abcnorio-astro/site-frontend
ASTRO_BUILD_WORKDIR_HOST_DIR=/host/path/to/abcnorio-meta/build/astro
ASTRO_BUILD_ARCHIVE_HOST_DIR=/host/path/to/abcnorio-meta/build/astro/build-archives
ASTRO_WEBCOMPONENTS_DIR=/host/path/to/abcnorio-webcomponents

# --- Docs (Starlight) ---
DOCS_HOST_ROOT=/host/path/to/abcnorio-docs

# --- Domains (bare hostnames — used by Caddy directly, and by compose to construct full URLs) ---
# DOMAIN_WP_* → proxied WordPress admin/REST endpoints
# DOMAIN_* → Astro frontend virtual hosts
# Compose constructs https://${DOMAIN_*}/ for containers that need full URLs.
DOMAIN_WP_DEV=your-wp-dev-domain.example
DOMAIN_WP_STAGING=your-wp-staging-domain.example
DOMAIN_DEV=dev.your-domain.example
DOMAIN_STAGING=staging.your-domain.example
DOMAIN_PRODUCTION=your-main-domain.example
DOMAIN_PREVIEW=preview.your-domain.example
DOMAIN_DOCS=docs.your-domain.example

# --- Orchestrator ---
ORCHESTRATOR_HOST_DIR=/host/path/to/abcnorio-orchestrator

# --- Plugin source (dev bind mount) ---
# Use the canonical absolute host path for the plugin source repo.
# Dev WordPress mounts this path directly to /app/web/app/plugins/abcnorio-func.
ABCNORIO_FUNC_HOST_DIR=/host/path/to/abcnorio-func

# --- CMS base URLs (full URL, passed to Astro + WP plugin via compose) ---
DOMAIN_DEV_CMS=https://your-wp-dev-domain.example/
DOMAIN_STAGING_CMS=https://your-wp-staging-domain.example/

# --- Search API paths (relative to CMS base URL) ---
DEV_SEARCH_API=wp-json/abcnorio/v1/search
STAGING_SEARCH_API=wp-json/abcnorio/v1/search
